Plugin artwork
--------------
The SVGs in icons/ are named by their SHA-256 content hash. The matching
plugins/*.json entries identify each source and its two variants.

Qobuz: the circular Q paths from qobuz_logo_spinner in
https://www.qobuz.com/assets-static/build/images/logos.dbcc769d.svg
The three white logo paths are preserved, rendered black on transparency,
without the spinner background or outline.

Spotify: the unmodified Primary_Logo_Black_RGB.svg from the icon download at
https://developer.spotify.com/documentation/design#using-our-logo

Jamendo: the unmodified icon paths from the white logo at
https://images.jamendo.com/jamendomusic/static/svg/jamendo-music-logo-white.svg
The icon is presented separately from its wordmark.

These brand assets were retrieved on 2026-10-30. Artwork and trademarks
remain the property of their respective owners; listing them does not
license them under this repository's GPL or imply endorsement.

UPnP: original Kalinka artwork, GPL-3.0-or-later, copied from
KalinkaPlayer/packages/kalinka-plugin-upnp/src/kalinka_plugin_upnp/icons/.
This is a generic text mark, not the UPnP certification logo.

Roon: the plain wordmark from the header of https://roon.app/en/press
(retrieved 2026-10-31). Paths, stroke and viewBox are preserved; website
attributes were removed and an SVG namespace and title were added. This
is source attribution, not a Roon Ready, Roon Tested or certification badge.
